# PROD, HTTP. Daily use: low FP, low load. Rare fast_pattern + at least two independent signs,
# max 1 alert per source per 5 min. Also works on HTTPS decrypted by a TLS-inspecting proxy.
# UUID4 in base64: [0] in MNOYZ, [11]='t', [18]='0', [24]='L', [25] in TW, [31]='t' (base64 and base64url).
# Mythic C2 v3.4.36, HTTP C2 Profile, agent Medusa. Tested in Dalton on Suricata 7.0.14 and 8.0.7.

